            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The next step is to wait, wait as your Shadow Self materializes, wait as it comes to understand you and guide you.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_057.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It will take three nights. On the first night, the shadow will knock four times. Thump. Thump. Thump. Thump. It will leave you something.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_058.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "On the second night, it will visit you and ask you for a gift. You must deliver it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_059.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "On the third night, it will take you into the abyss and, if you emerge, the path to the Scholomance will begin.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_060.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There is an old cabin over there you can use when you are ready. Wait for the knocks and see what is left for you.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
